https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/blob/7af2f001b846a7a0ff4789d1c699825b473aa1d3/src/Datasource/EntityTrait.php#L672-L682\r\n\r\nafter changing the string `Cake\\ORM\\Entity` to `\\Cake\\ORM\\Entity::class` psalm reports error\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: RedundantCondition - src/Datasource/EntityTrait.php:626:13 - Found a redundant condition when evaluating $class and trying to reconcile type 'class-string(Cake\\ORM\\Entity)' to class-string(Cake\\ORM\\Entity)\r\n```\r\n\r\nSince `Cake\\Datasource\\EntityTrait` is used by `Cake\\ORM\\Entity` this error is understandable but the trait could be unused in some other class too, hence checking that `$class` does not evaluate to `Cake\\ORM\\Entity::class` is necessary, so check like `$class === \\Cake\\ORM\\Entity::class` should not throw an error.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1152/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1152/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]